# systemd: بديل pm2 — يعيد التشغيل تلقائياً حتى بعد إعادة تشغيل السيرفر نفسه
# التثبيت (كمستخدم غير جذري):
#   useradd --system --home /opt/tradebot --shell /usr/sbin/nologin tradebot
#   install -d -o tradebot -g tradebot /opt/tradebot
#   cp bot-server.js hq-entry.js /opt/tradebot/ && cp server/bot-server.service /etc/systemd/system/tradebot.service
#   systemctl daemon-reload && systemctl enable --now tradebot
#   journalctl -u tradebot -f
[Unit]
Description=TradeBot Binance 24/7
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=tradebot
Group=tradebot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/tradebot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/node /opt/tradebot/bot-server.js
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
# لا تضع BINANCE_KEY/SECRET هنا. استخدم EnvironmentFile بصلاحيات 0600:
# EnvironmentFile=/etc/tradebot.env
Environment=MODE=paper
Environment=STAKE_USD=10
Environment=TP_USD=0.7
Environment=MIN_TP_USD=0.3
Environment=MAX_TRADES=3
Environment=DAILY_MAX_LOSS=10
Environment=DAILY_GOAL_USD=10
Environment=EQUITY_START=100
Environment=POLL_SEC=60
Environment=SECURITY_MAX_STAKE_USD=10
Environment=SECURITY_MAX_TRADES=3
Environment=SECURITY_MAX_DAILY_LOSS=10
Environment=SECURITY_REQUIRE_IP=1
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ReadWritePaths=/opt/tradebot

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
